6. Module specifications
Each module lists: tables owned, views (what they show, which APIs they call, special states), APIs, and rules. Tables listed are the delta and additions to the original blueprint schema; tenant tables always carry tenant_id + FORCE RLS (R-G01).
M1 — Identity and Access (AUTH)
Tables: users (global: id, email?, phone, password_hash, mfa_secret?, locale, status), tenant_memberships (user_id, tenant_id, role, status), refresh_tokens, devices (user, tenant, fingerprint, label, revoked_at), otp_challenges (purpose, code_hash, expires_at, attempts), guardian_claim_codes (learner_id, guardian_id, code_hash, expires_at, used_at).
