Rules
• R-TEN-01 Integration secrets are never returned by any endpoint.
• R-TEN-02 [V] In production, C2B URL registration is a one-time call; to change URLs they must be deleted in Safaricom self-service and re-registered. Transaction validation is optional and must be activated by Safaricom on the shortcode. The UI must confirm before registering and explain this.
• R-TEN-03 Institution codes are validated by non-empty format only; official formats are [O].
• R-TEN-04 Changing the shortcode requires HEAD, a reason, and an audit event.
M3 — Calendar, Structure and Staff (CAL, STR, STF)
Tables: academic_years, terms, exam_windows (type: KPSEA|KJSEA|INTERNAL|OTHER, start, end), grades (global reference: PP1, PP2, G1–G9 with level_band), streams, class_groups (year, grade, stream, class_teacher_id), staff_profiles (membership_id, TSC no. and national ID encrypted, subjects), teaching_assignments (staff, class_group, learning_area_id, year).
