Rules
• R-CAL-01 Terms must not overlap and must sit inside their academic year; exactly one term is current.
• R-CAL-02 [V] 2026 seed: Term 1 5 Jan–2 Apr (mid-term 25 Feb–1 Mar); Term 2 27 Apr–31 Jul (half-term 24–28 Jun); Term 3 24 Aug–23 Oct; long holiday 26 Oct–1 Jan 2027. KPSEA dates conflict between sources (26–28 vs 26–29 Oct); store whatever the head confirms. 2027 template is [O].
• R-STR-01 class_groups unique on (tenant, year, grade, stream).
• R-STF-01 An assessment event cannot open for a class group and learning area that has no assigned teacher.
• R-STF-02 TSC number format is [O]; stored encrypted; optional.
M4 — Learners, Guardians, Enrolment (LRN, GRD, ENR, IMP)
Tables: learners (admission_no, upi?, names, dob, gender, birth_cert_no_enc, sne_enc, photo_ref, status, admitted_on, previous_school), guardians (names, phone, alt_phone, id_no_enc, email, language, user_id?), learner_guardians (relationship, is_primary_payer, is_emergency_contact, can_collect), enrolments (learner, class_group, year, status, started_on, ended_on), learner_status_history, transfers, import_batches, import_rows.
This replaces static grade_level/stream_name and the single parent_phone_number on students [A].
