Rules
• R-KNE-01 Only results with source KNEC_SBA_TOOL feed this module.
• R-KNE-02 Status flow: NOT_ASSESSED → CAPTURED → MODERATED → EXPORTED → CONFIRMED_UPLOADED. Only HEAD sets the last state.
• R-KNE-03 [V] 2026 cycle for Grades 3, 4, 5, 7, 8: tools opened 28 Sep and the last upload date was 23 Oct. Earlier cycles had extended deadlines, so deadlines are editable data.
• R-KNE-04 Portal steps for the user manual [V]: log in at the CBA portal, choose Capture Assessment Outcomes, select the learning area. Sheets list learners in admission-number order per class [A].
• R-KNE-05 [V] Foundation-level SNE tools are PDF-only; flagged learners are excluded from digital-entry assumptions.
• R-KNE-06 [O] The exact portal upload template is unknown; build the export as a pluggable template and obtain a real manual from a head teacher login before finalising.
