Rules
• R-RPT-01 A published snapshot is immutable. A correction creates revision N+1 and notifies the parent; the old revision remains visible in history.
• R-RPT-02 Pre-publish checks (configurable): every learning area for the grade has a result, class-teacher comment present, head comment present.
• R-RPT-03 Learning areas on a card come from the learner's pinned curriculum version and grade band (lower vs upper primary differ, see M5).
• R-RPT-04 Card content: school branding, learner details, learning-area levels, competencies and values, attendance summary, comments, next-term dates. KPSEA results come from KNEC and are not generated here [A].
• R-RPT-05 Withholding report cards for fee arrears is OFF by default (D-04); enabling it shows a legal-review warning and an audit event.
• R-PAR-01 A guardian sees only learners linked in learner_guardians; fee visibility is a per-link flag.
• R-PAR-02 Parent endpoints return only published or parent-facing data; row filter is enforced in the query, not the UI.
• R-PAR-03 Low-bandwidth targets [A]: JSON responses under 30 KB per page, lazy images, no large client bundles; read-only offline cache of last viewed screens.
