Rules
• R-PLT-01 Suspension makes the tenant read-only after a configurable grace period [A]. Payment webhooks are still recorded while suspended; money events are never dropped.
• R-PLT-02 The platform uses one schema with RLS, so "force schema migration" is an idempotent, logged data-migration job per tenant, not per-tenant DDL [A].
• R-PLT-03 Impersonation: reason required, maximum 60 minutes, read-only by default, school head notified, banner shown, all actions written to both the tenant and platform audit logs [A].
• R-PLT-04 Sensitive fields (R-G08) stay masked even during impersonation unless a break-glass approval from the school head is recorded [A].
• R-PLT-05 Pricing [A]: per learner per term with tiers. Market reference points [V, other vendors]: one lists KES 250 per learner per term per pack plus a KES 34,800 setup fee for its bursar pack; another sells flat per-term prices (KES 15,000 up to 200 learners, KES 35,000 up to 1,000). Prices are configuration.
