Method: every view in §5 was checked against the API tables (does each action have an endpoint?) and every endpoint against the view tables (does something call it?). Endpoints with no view by design: API-AUTH-05/06 (infrastructure), all WH-* webhooks, API-GATE-02 (device WebSocket), API-GATE-03 (device replay), J-* jobs.
